1	line	Player	What's going on here?
1	line	Guard	Oh, it's terrible! Lord Sinclair has been murdered and we don't have any clues as to who or why. We're totally baffled!
1	line	Guard	If you can help us we will be very grateful.
1	select	Start the Murder Mystery quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Sure, I'll help!
2	line	Guard	Thanks a lot!
2	line	Player	What should I be doing to help?
2	line	Guard	Look around and investigate who might be responsible. The Sarge said every murder leaves clues to who done it, but frankly we're out of our depth here.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	You should do your own dirty work.
2	line	Guard	Get lost then, this is private property! ...Unless you'd like to be taken in for questioning yourself?
2	action	end
