0	section	Talking to Pierre
1	line	Player	I'm here to help the guards with their investigation.
1	line	Pierre	How can I help?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Who do you think is responsible?
2	line	Player	Who do you think is responsible?
2	line	Pierre	Honestly? I think it was Carol.
2	line	Pierre	I saw her in a huge argument with Lord Sinclair in the library the other day. It was something to do with stolen books. She definitely seemed upset enough to have done it afterwards.
2	action	end
1	option	Where were you at the time of the murder?
