2	action	end
1	option	Did you hear any suspicious noises at all?
2	line	Player	Did you hear any suspicious noises at all?
2	line	Pierre	Well, like what?
2	line	Player	Any sounds of a struggle with Lord Sinclair?
2	line	Pierre	No, I don't remember hearing anything like that.
2	line	Player	How about the guard dog barking at all?
2	line	Pierre	I hear him bark all the time. It's one of his favorite things to do. I can't say I did the night of the murder though as I wasn't close enough to hear either way.
2	action	end
