0	section	Visiting the Poison Salesman
0	section	Talking to the Poison Salesman
1	line	Player	I'm investigating the murder at the Sinclair house.
1	line	Poison Salesman	There was a murder at the Sinclair House??? That's terrible! And I was only there the other day too! They bought the last of my Patented Multi Purpose Poison!
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Patented Multi Purpose Poison?
2	line	Player	Patented Multi Purpose Poison?
2	line	Poison Salesman	Aaaaah... a miracle of modern apothecaries!
2	line	Poison Salesman	This exclusive concoction has been tested on all known forms of life and been proven to kill them all in varying dilutions from cockroaches to king dragons!
2	line	Poison Salesman	So incredibly versatile, it can be used as pest control, a cleansing agent, drain cleaner, metal polish and washes whiter than white,
2	line	Poison Salesman	all with our uniquely fragrant concoction that is immediately recognisable across the land as Peter Potter's Patented Poison potion!!!
2	box	The salesman stops for breath.
2	line	Poison Salesman	I'd love to sell you some but I've sold out recently. That's just how good it is! Three hundred and twenty eight people in this area alone cannot be wrong!
2	line	Poison Salesman	Nine out of Ten poisoners prefer it in controlled tests!
2	line	Poison Salesman	Can I help you with anything else?
2	line	Poison Salesman	Perhaps I can take your name and add it to our mailing list of poison users? We will only send you information related to the use of poison and other Peter Potter Products!
2	line	Player	Uh... no, it's ok. Really.
2	action	end
1	option	Who did you sell Poison to at the house?
2	line	Player	Who did you sell Poison to at the house?
2	line	Poison Salesman	Well, Peter Potter's Patented Multi Purpose Poison is a product of such obvious quality that I am glad to say I managed to sell a bottle to each of the Sinclairs!
2	line	Poison Salesman	Anna, Bob, Carol, David, Elizabeth and Frank all bought a bottle! In fact they bought the last of my supplies!
2	line	Poison Salesman	Maybe I can take your name and address and I will personally come and visit you when stocks return?
2	line	Player	Uh... no, it's ok.
2	action	end
1	option	Can I buy some Poison?
2	line	Player	Can I buy some Poison?
2	line	Poison Salesman	I'm afraid I am totally out of stock at the moment after my successful trip to the Sinclairs' House the other day.
2	line	Poison Salesman	But don't worry! Our factories are working overtime to produce Peter Potter's Patented Multi Purpose Poison!
2	line	Poison Salesman	Possibly the finest multi purpose poison and cleaner yet available to the general market.
2	line	Poison Salesman	And its unique fragrance makes it the number one choice for cleaners and exterminators the whole country over!
2	action	end
1	option	I have this pot I found at the murder scene...
2	line	Player	I have this pot I found at the murder scene...
2	box	You show the poison salesman the pot you found at the murder scene with the unusual smell.
2	line	Poison Salesman	Hmmm... yes, that smells exactly like my Patented Multi Purpose Poison, but I don't see how it could be. It quite clearly says on the label of all bottles
2	line	Poison Salesman	'Not to be taken internally - EXTREMELY POISONOUS'.
2	line	Player	Perhaps someone else put it in his wine?
2	line	Poison Salesman	Yes... I suppose that could have happened...
2	action	end
